      "langevin_step_ms is a single-trajectory, single-step latency (one langevin_step call), not a batched-throughput number -- E11d's analog of E11a/E11b's score_grad_ms.",
      "Both impls get one untimed warmup call per (length, metric) before timing (JAX: forces jit compilation; PyTorch: cache/allocator warm-up).",
