      "Only the plain Euler-Maruyama langevin_step path is benchmarked (use_metropolis=False) -- metropolis_hastings_step is not exercised here.",
      "A row with impl='error' means that (protein_length, batch_size) cell raised during timing (see its 'error' field) -- all other cells in this file completed normally and are unaffected."
